#!/bin/sh
# Write the current epoch seconds to "$1/since". Used by the Coffee service to
# persist the keep-awake start time inside the plugin's own state dir (R8);
# the value is read back on load so "Awake for" survives a shell reload.
set -eu
dir=${1:?state dir required}
mkdir -p "$dir"
date +%s > "$dir/since"
